-- Reach Higher Level 3A (National Geographic Learning), Units 1-4: one row per
-- teaching block, the eight 90-minute lessons a unit takes at Jupiter's pace
-- (3 hours a week; the publisher's pacing guide gives a unit 4 weeks). The deck
-- files in src/content/lessonDecks/rh-l3-u*.ts name these blocks in `covers`, so
-- presenting a deck marks the block as taught and the lesson report starts from
-- its objectives (src/lib/curriculumLessons.ts orders them).
--
-- Objectives are the school's own wording. sb_page is the first 3A Student Book
-- page of the block's deck (Unit 1, which has only its Wrap-Up deck, follows the
-- Teacher's Edition lessons). Words are the book's key words, on the block whose
-- deck teaches them (science words on the unit opener's page go with the Unit
-- Launch where its deck teaches them). Language function, reading strategy,
-- phonics, grammar point and selections are the Teacher's Edition's for that part,
-- on the block whose pages hold them.
--
-- Needs 20261121150000_curriculum_lessons.sql. Safe to run twice (it updates in place).
BEGIN;
